WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Sanké Mon — Collective Fishing Rite
San, Ségou Region, Mali

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[Thousands gather at the sacred Sanké pond —
communities enter the water together in coordinated action]

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
[A rite commemorating the founding of the town
more than six centuries ago]

4
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
[UNESCO Intangible Cultural Heritage —
still practiced, still uniting a community]
